  "dates": "Public briefing: The public briefing call will be held on October 13, 2022. The public briefing call will begin at 9 a.m. Eastern Daylight Time (EDT) local time and conclude at 10 a.m. EDT. The telephone number for attending this event will be posted on the BIS website at https://bis.doc.gov/index.php/about-bis/newsroom/2082 no later than October 7 at 5 p.m.",
